      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Dark navigation with a lighter navy current slide and gold underline.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Lesson slides\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-link\" aria-current=\"true\">Make technology work for you</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-link\">A useful first task</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{background:#102c4b;padding:1.3rem}.ds-link{font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Geneva,Verdana,sans-serif;display:block;width:100%;min-height:44px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:#e1edf6;text-align:left;font-size:16px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:500;padding:12px;margin:.2rem 0;cursor:pointer}.ds-link:hover{background:#244b70}.ds-link[aria-current=true]{background:#2a5277;color:#fff;box-shadow:inset 0 -3px #e4b62e;font-weight:700}.ds-link:focus-visible{outline:4px solid #f3d66b;outline-offset:4px}.ds-link:active{transform:translateY(1px)}",
